dandelion: forward-port to Evolution X 12.2 (Android 17)

Keeps the stock Android 10 vendor (BUILD_WITHOUT_VENDOR) and prebuilt 4.9 kernel.
- Evolution X flags (Vanilla, 720x1600, blur/quick tap/face unlock off), Qualcomm
  trees excluded from Soong analysis
- A-only (AB_OTA_UPDATER false), unquoted TARGET_RECOVERY_PIXEL_FORMAT, system/product
  sized to content (dynamic partitions), BUILD_BROKEN_MISSING_REQUIRED_MODULES
- libui legacy_gralloc (vendor has gralloc mapper 2.1 / allocator 2.0)
- VNDK v29 APEX and libaudiohal@5.0 packages; InProcessNetworkStack removed (gone in A17)
- ro.bpf.allow_legacy_kernel, sys.usb.controller=musb-hdrc, USB state seed rc
- A17 build.prop override keys (BuildDesc/BuildFingerprint)
- light HAL: drop removed <hardware/lights.h>; libshim_showlogo ported to A17 libgui
- sepolicy: coredomain/system_file_type for system-side HALs, -isolated_app_all
- remove vendorsetup.sh (it deleted and re-cloned frameworks/opt/telephony)

